      <div class="kl-mockup-grid">
        <div class="kl-mini-card">
          <div class="kl-mini-label">Week-over-Week Read</div>
          <p class="kl-mini-body">
            Your morning sessions showed calm preparation, while Thursday afternoon was the only session where an unplanned trade occurred.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="kl-mini-card">
          <div class="kl-mini-label" style="color:#F5C518;">Next Week's Priority</div>
          <p class="kl-mini-body">
            Cap daily execution at two setups maximum and log your session reflection immediately after closing charts.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 9 — FAQ
       Very clean accordion
       ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="kl-section kl-section--border" id="resources">
    <div style="text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="kl-eyebrow">FAQ</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.4vw,2.6rem);margin:0;">Common questions about KAIZEN.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="kl-faq-list">
      <div class="kl-faq-item is-open">
        <button type="button" class="kl-faq-q" data-faq-toggle>
          <span>What is KAIZEN?</span>
          <span class="kl-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="kl-faq-a">
          KAIZEN is a Trader Development Platform. It combines structured session reflection, goal accountability, weekly progress synthesis, and KAIZEN AI behavioral coaching to help you develop consistent execution habits.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kl-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="kl-faq-q" data-faq-toggle>
          <span>Does KAIZEN provide trading signals or market predictions?</span>
          <span class="kl-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="kl-faq-a">
          Never. KAIZEN does not issue trade alerts, signals, or market predictions. Your strategy is yours—KAIZEN focuses entirely on how well you execute your plan and manage your behavior.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kl-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="kl-faq-q" data-faq-toggle>
          <span>How does goal tracking work without complicated spreadsheets?</span>
          <span class="kl-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="kl-faq-a">
          You simply state the goal you want to achieve and why it matters to you. Whenever you log and reflect on a trading session, KAIZEN interprets your session behavior and updates your goal progress automatically.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kl-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="kl-faq-q" data-faq-toggle>
          <span>How do I join the Early Access Beta and test KAIZEN?</span>
          <span class="kl-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="kl-faq-a">
          Enter your details in the Join Beta section below to join our early-user pipeline and proceed directly to create your Beta account and test the live platform.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
